cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClaudLand in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ClaudLand: a Python reconstruction framework for KamLAND raw data"
abstract: >-
  Reads KamLAND Serial Format raw-data files (.sf/.sfz), decompresses the ATWD
  waveforms, extracts hit times and charges, fits event vertices with window and
  maximum-likelihood (time and charge) fitters, estimates the visible energy and
  reconstructs muon tracks with a joint first-light-time and charge-pattern fit.
authors:
  - family-names: Decowski
    given-names: M. P.
    affiliation: "Nikhef and University of Amsterdam"
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
    website: "https://www.anthropic.com/claude"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/decowski/ClaudLand"
keywords:
  - KamLAND
  - neutrino
  - liquid scintillator
  - event reconstruction
  - muon tracking
